<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Account Under Review &bull; StayNest Host</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;1,400;1,500;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-beige: #FAF7F0;
            --surface-card: #FFFFFF;
            --emerald-dark: #0f261b;
            --emerald-mid: #143528;
            --gold-accent: #D4AF6A;
            --text-dark: #121A16;
            --text-muted: #6B7770;
            --border-light: #E8E2D5;
        }

        *, *::before, *::after {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-beige);
            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 32px 20px;
        }

        .review-card {
            background: var(--surface-card);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: 28px;
            padding: 48px 40px;
            max-width: 480px;
            width: 100%;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 45px -10px rgba(18, 43, 32, 0.08);
        }

        .icon-wrap {
            width: 64px;
            height: 64px;
            background: #FAF7F0;
            border: 1.5px solid var(--gold-accent);
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 24px auto;
            color: var(--gold-accent);
        }

        .badge-tag {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.2em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: var(--gold-accent);
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        .review-title {
            font-family: 'Playfair Display', Georgia, serif;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--emerald-dark);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .review-desc {
            font-size: 14.5px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
        }

        .btn-return {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: 48px;
            background: var(--emerald-mid);
            color: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: 9999px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-bottom: 14px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-return:hover {
            background: #0B1C14;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .btn-logout {
            background: none;
            border: none;
            font-family: inherit;
            font-size: 13.5px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: color 0.15s ease;
        }

        .btn-logout:hover {
            color: #B91C1C;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="review-card">
        <div class="icon-wrap">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
                <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
            </svg>
        </div>

        <span class="badge-tag">Verification Status</span>
        <h1 class="review-title">Host Account Under Review</h1>
        <p class="review-desc">
            We have received your host profile. Our curation concierge reviews each architectural space to ensure the highest standards for StayNest travelers. You will receive an email once your account is live.
        </p>

        <a href="/" class="btn-return">Explore Stays</a>

        <form action="/auth/logout" method="POST">
            <button type="submit" class="btn-logout">
                Sign out of account
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
